+# EVALPATH forensic completion criterion
+
+Complete when one deterministic command using the mandated interpreter (1) constructs
+real v0.25 provider tapes and real anchor/catalogue `Configuration` objects, (2) compares
+at least 200 identical objects through fresh scalar and dense-batch `StepEvaluator`
+instances, (3) serializes raw comparisons, first-divergence probes, and consistency
+checks to `comparisons.json`, and (4) the written report answers Q1--Q4 with line-cited
+evidence and prints verbatim to stdout.
+

